Dear Sir or Madam,

=20

The Government Legal Department are instructed by the Secretary of State fo=
r Justice (=E2=80=9CSSJ=E2=80=9D) and Her Majesty=E2=80=99s Court and Tribunals Service (=E2=80=9CHM=
CTS=E2=80=9D) in the above proceedings.

=20

The SSJ and HMCTS=E2=80=99s Acknowledgment of Service and Summary Grounds of Resp=
onse are due to be filed on 29 December 2025. Accordingly, please find enclo=
sed an application for an extension of time. The Claimant is copied into thi=
s correspondence. =20

=20

Please find attached:

=20

1.              N244 application.

2.              Draft order.

3.              Fee form for =C2=A3313.00.

=20

Please do let me know if the Court requires any further information.=20

=20

Kind regards,

=20

Roisin=20

=20

=20

Roisin Hediger Howard

Junior Lawyer - MoJ, Public Law & SASO team, Justice and Development Divisi=
on

Division A - Government Legal Department

7-8 Wellington Place, Leeds, LS1 4AP

Email: roisin.hedigerhoward@governmentlegal.gov.uk

Mobile: 07860372758

